ASoC: amd: acp-config: use SoundWire driver on HP OmniBook X Flip 14 (8EA1)

The BIOS acp-audio-config-flag on this board selects the legacy DMIC-only
driver, so snd_pci_ps never binds and the SoundWire codecs (2x TAS2783,
RT712-VB) are not used. Add a DMI override so the ACP 7.x picks snd_pci_ps.
Equivalent fix is upstream in Linux 7.3.

--- a/sound/soc/amd/acp-config.c
+++ b/sound/soc/amd/acp-config.c
@@ -63,6 +63,13 @@
 			DMI_MATCH(DMI_PRODUCT_NAME, "Vivobook 18 M1807GA"),
 		},
 	},
+	{
+		/* HP OmniBook X Flip Laptop 14-kc0xxx (local override) */
+		.matches = {
+			DMI_MATCH(DMI_BOARD_VENDOR, "HP"),
+			DMI_MATCH(DMI_BOARD_NAME, "8EA1"),
+		},
+	},
 	{}
 };
 
